<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<title>CryoBackup daily digest, {{.Date}}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:{{tok "bg"}};color:{{tok "text"}};font-family:'IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:{{tok "bg"}};">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:20px;">
<table role="presentation" width="640" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:640px;background:{{tok "surface"}};border:1px solid {{tok "border"}};border-radius:8px;">
<tr><td style="padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid {{tok "border"}};">
<div style="font-weight:800;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:{{tok "text"}};">CRYOBACKUP</div>
<div style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px;color:{{tok "text-muted"}};">daily digest, {{.Date}} &middot; polled {{.Polled}}</div>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 20px 4px 20px;">
<h1 style="margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:{{tok "text"}};">{{.Title}}</h1>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:12px 20px 0 20px;">
<div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:{{tok "text-muted"}};padding-bottom:6px;">Console</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
{{if .Banners}}{{range .Banners}}<tr><td style="padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid {{tok .Colour}};border-bottom:1px solid {{tok "border"}};">
<span style="color:{{tok .Colour}};font-weight:600;">{{.Glyph}} {{.Word}}</span> {{.Text}}
</td></tr>
{{end}}{{else}}<tr><td style="padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid {{tok "success"}};border-bottom:1px solid {{tok "border"}};">
<span style="color:{{tok "success"}};font-weight:600;">&#9679; OK</span> No console condition: every self-check passes.
</td></tr>
{{end}}</table>
</td></tr>
{{range .Sections}}<tr><td style="padding:16px 20px 0 20px;">
<div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:{{tok "text-muted"}};padding-bottom:6px;">{{.Title}}</div>
{{if .Groups}}{{$s := .}}{{range .Groups}}<div style="font-weight:600;padding:6px 0 4px 0;">{{.Customer}}{{if .Muted}} <span style="font-weight:400;font-size:12px;color:{{tok "text-muted"}};">(suspended: notifications muted)</span>{{end}}</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
{{range .Lines}}<tr><td style="padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid {{tok $s.Colour}};border-bottom:1px solid {{tok "border"}};">
<span style="color:{{tok $s.Colour}};font-weight:600;">{{$s.Glyph}} {{.State}}</span>
{{if .Host}}<strong style="font-weight:600;">{{.Host}}</strong>{{else}}no active device{{end}}{{if .Ack}} <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:{{tok "text-muted"}};">{{.Ack}}</span>{{end}}
{{if or .Since .Also .Indefinite}}<div style="font-size:12px;color:{{tok "text-muted"}};">{{if .Since}}since {{.Since}}{{end}}{{if .Indefinite}}; paused with no end date{{end}}{{if .Also}}; also {{.Also}}{{end}}</div>{{end}}
</td></tr>
{{end}}</table>
{{end}}{{else}}<div style="font-size:12px;color:{{tok "text-muted"}};">None. {{$.CheckedAs}} checked.</div>
{{end}}</td></tr>
{{end}}<tr><td style="padding:16px 20px;">
<p style="margin:0;color:{{tok "text"}};"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Totals:</strong> {{.Totals}}</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:12px 20px;border-top:1px solid {{tok "border"}};font-size:12px;color:{{tok "text-muted"}};">
{{if .ConsoleURL}}<a href="{{.ConsoleURL}}" style="color:{{tok "accent"}};">Open the console</a>: {{.ConsoleURL}}<br>{{else}}Open the console to see the details.<br>{{end}}
This digest is sent every day, also when everything is green: a day without it means the console or its mail has stopped.<br>
You receive this because this address receives the CryoBackup daily digest.
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
